                                                "sense_id": "77134154-cb94-3011-ae0e-98e8e6580e2b",
                                                "text": "Our findings indicate that superspreading is a normal feature of disease spread[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6a96803-64bf-43c4-9e32-bfd4d23961dd",
                                                "sense_id": "77134154-cb94-3011-ae0e-98e8e6580e2b",
                                                "text": "We found that superspreading has overwhelmingly contributed to the transmission of SARS-CoV-2 in the city overall. Of the 349 local cases we identified — the remaining 689 cases were imported from other territories — 196 were linked to just six superspreading events."
                                            }
